# Review Subagent Gate（Cursor）

叙事：[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) + [AGENTS_CURSOR.md](../../AGENTS_CURSOR.md)（双文件注入）· [harness_architecture.md](../../docs/harness_architecture/index.md) · [harness_policy_map.md](../../docs/harness_policy_map.md) · [host_adapter_contract.md](../../docs/host_adapter_contract.md) §0.1 · [code-review-deep/SKILL.md](../../skills/code-review-deep/SKILL.md)

**清门真源（Claude canonical）**：`core-policy::review_gate_satisfied` — armed 时须 `independent_reviewer_seen`（`reviewer_lanes` + `fork_context=false`）或 override；Cursor **不得**用 multiset pending 单独替代此条件。

**Hook 硬约束**

- **`REVIEW_GATE`（全宿主）**：Stop **advisory-only**——仅 `followup_message` 等 nudge，**不** `permission: deny` / 硬拦 Stop
- **spawn-first**：非 my-light 时 registry `spawn_first_enabled`；`beforeSubmitPrompt` 注入配对审稿 nudge
- **my-light**：**suppress** `REVIEW_GATE` nudge 与 spawn-first（model inherit → [subagent-model-inherit.mdc](subagent-model-inherit.mdc)）
- **深度 review**：可数 lane（registry `reviewer_lanes`）；`fork_context=false` JSON 显式（缺字段推断默认关，`ROUTER_RS_REVIEW_FORK_CONTEXT_MISSING_INFER_FALSE`）；`explore` 不计入
- **Cursor 遥测**：`review_subagent_pending_cycle_keys` / review-lite vec **仅** phase bump 与 operator 提示，非 Stop 硬条件
- **窄范围** / 用户禁 subagent：不武装 `review_required`
- **Stop**：`.cursor/hook-state` + advisory `router-rs REVIEW_GATE` / `AG_FOLLOWUP`；`rg_clear` / `reject_reason` 为 override 信号（closeout 硬门禁另轨）
- review lane **只读**；纯 review 禁止默认改代码/提交（除非用户显式要求）
